{"n":128,"videoId":"4CHiN9xdnPs","question":"Who Is The Most Beautiful Person?","method":"premiere","answers":[{"t":8.09,"dur":1.63,"text":"My grandma","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/002.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":9.72,"dur":2.84,"text":"For celebrities maybe... Emma Watson or something like that","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/003.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":12.55,"dur":1.46,"text":"My fiancee","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/003.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":14.01,"dur":2.88,"text":"Jesus Christ... Very good question. I'm blanking.","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/004.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":16.89,"dur":2.42,"text":"I don't know, you","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/004.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":21.02,"dur":1.29,"text":"My mother","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":22.31,"dur":2.79,"text":"[looks to his girlfriend] my girlfriend","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":25.11,"dur":8.59,"text":"The first name that came to my mind... Was Erykah Badu I really like her music She's beautiful.","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":33.7,"dur":1.75,"text":"I would say my kids","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":35.45,"dur":1.34,"text":"Sophie Marceau","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":36.79,"dur":9.8,"text":"There was this lady once I saw on the tram. She was sitting in front of me, and she had kind of like, brownish blondish hair, and her eyes were this bluish greenish mix","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":46.59,"dur":12.97,"text":"that was exactly the same color as my earphones that I don't have anymore, because they broke. But it was like so light eyes. And she was beautiful. And I think she might be the most beautiful person on earth","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":59.56,"dur":1.71,"text":"Rebecca Ferguson","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":61.27,"dur":1.17,"text":"I got to say, my mom","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":62.44,"dur":2.42,"text":"kindest person in the world, according to me","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":64.86,"dur":3.92,"text":"My sister, my little sister, she's the most beautiful","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":68.78,"dur":1.54,"text":"My own grandmother","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":70.32,"dur":1.92,"text":"Eva Longoria","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":73.7,"dur":3.42,"text":"Maybe my mother,","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":77.12,"dur":1.04,"text":"my brother","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":78.16,"dur":8.63,"text":"not one person but, when somebody is doing something, which is really their passion,","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":86.8,"dur":6.72,"text":"ike playing an instrument or dancing [Being] in this state, it’s the most beautiful state of human being","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":96.6,"dur":4.38,"text":"the reflex [answer] is my girlfriend, but I don't know","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":100.98,"dur":5.59,"text":"I don't have an answer for that. I think everyone is beautiful in their own way.","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":106.56,"dur":2.67,"text":"Ya I would say that as well","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":109.23,"dur":2.63,"text":"Of all time?!","frame":"4CHiN9xdnPs/005.jpg","role":"respondent","why":"default"},{"t":111.86,"dur":3.59,"text":"let's say... Cleopatra","frame":"4CHiN9